  "name": "jarvis",
  "description": "A medical simulation and visualization platform developed in Unity that bridges physical sensor data with high-fidelity virtual environments. The system utilizes Arduino-based hardware for real-time biometric telemetry, rendering interactive surgical and morgue scenarios using Physically Based Rendering (PBR) workflows. It is designed for clinical training and immersive physiological data integration within 3D spaces.",
